# Warp Relay: UDP port mappings
# One mapping per line:
#   SRC_IP  SRC_PORT  DST_HOST_OR_IP  DST_PORT  LABEL
#
# SRC_IP is informational (the rules match any LOCAL address of this node).
# SRC_PORT is the UDP port clients connect to on the relay.
# DST_HOST may be a hostname: it is re-resolved on every apply and by the watchdog.
#
# Cloudflare WARP (the WireGuard data port is 2408, not 4500):
0.0.0.0  4500   engage.cloudflareclient.com  2408   cloudflare-warp
# WireGuard or AmneziaWG server abroad, same port on both sides:
0.0.0.0  51820  wg.example.com               51820  wg-germany
# Different external and internal ports:
0.0.0.0  40000  203.0.113.10                 51821  awg-finland
